---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/common/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/common/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Iteron | Takedown and IP Policy"
  description="Takedown and intellectual property complaint process for Iteron."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="page-container">
    <header class="header-box brutalist-block">
      <h1 class="glitch" data-text="TAKEDOWN POLICY">TAKEDOWN POLICY</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">> EFFECTIVE DATE: 6 APRIL 2026 | LAST UPDATED: 6 APRIL 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <p>
        This policy explains how to report copyright, privacy, or other rights concerns
        related to content on Iteron.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>1. What You Can Report</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Copyright infringement or unauthorized reuse of your protected content.</li>
        <li>Privacy violations involving personal information.</li>
        <li>Defamation, impersonation, or other unlawful/rights-violating content.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>2. How to Submit a Complaint</h2>
      <p>
        Send an email to <a href="mailto:iteron.iiserm@gmail.com">iteron.iiserm@gmail.com</a>
        with subject line "Takedown Request" and include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your full name and contact information.</li>
        <li>URL(s) or exact content identifiers you want reviewed.</li>
        <li>A clear description of the issue and the rights involved.</li>
        <li>Evidence supporting your claim (ownership proof, authorization context, screenshots, etc.).</li>
        <li>A good-faith statement that the information you provide is accurate.</li>
        <li>A statement that you understand false or bad-faith claims may lead to restriction of reporting access.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>3. Evidence Requirement for Claims</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Copyright, plagiarism, or ownership claims must include sufficient supporting proof.
        </li>
        <li>
          Useful evidence may include dated drafts, commit history, version logs, timestamps,
          notebooks, communications, or equivalent verifiable records.
        </li>
        <li>
          Unsupported or purely conclusory allegations may be declined or closed without action.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>4. Independent Creation and Similarity</h2>
      <p>
        Similarity between submissions can occur through independent creation. Similar outcomes alone do not
        automatically establish copying or infringement. Where evidence supports independent creation,
        organizers may recognize credit for all independently creating participants.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>5. Review Process</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We target acknowledgment within 72 hours of receiving a complaint.</li>
        <li>We may request additional details to evaluate the complaint.</li>
        <li>Where appropriate, we may temporarily unpublish content during review.</li>
        <li>We target an initial decision within 14 calendar days, subject to complexity and evidence quality.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>6. Possible Outcomes</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No action, where evidence is insufficient or no violation is found.</li>
        <li>Request for correction, clarification, or attribution update.</li>
        <li>Temporary unpublishing during extended review.</li>
        <li>Permanent removal, restriction, or other enforcement consistent with Terms of Use.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>7. Counter-Statement and Appeal</h2>
      <p>
        If your content was removed and you believe this was in error, you may send a response with
        supporting evidence. We may restore content when justified.
      </p>
      <p>
        Counter-statements should be sent within 14 calendar days of notice of action, unless a longer
        period is required by applicable law or expressly granted by organizers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>8. Abuse of Process</h2>
      <p>
        Fraudulent, abusive, or repetitive bad-faith reports may be rejected and may result in
        restriction from further reporting channels.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-card brutalist-block">
      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Primary contact for takedown and rights concerns:
        <a href="mailto:iteron.iiserm@gmail.com">iteron.iiserm@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding: 120px 5% 5rem;
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .header-box {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-color: var(--accent-purple);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    color: var(--text-white);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  .legal-card {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-color: var(--text-white);
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .legal-card p,
  .legal-card li {
    color: #cfcfcf;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .legal-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .legal-card li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-card li::before {
    content: ">";
    color: var(--accent-purple);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-container {
      padding: 110px 1.25rem 3.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
  }
</style>
